<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>✨ Мой блог — Sofia</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --red-primary: #c41e3a;
      --red-dark: #8b0000;
      --red-light: #ff6b6b;
      --red-glow: rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.3);
      --bg-dark: #0a0a0f;
      --bg-card: #14141f;
      --bg-card-hover: #1a1a28;
      --text-primary: #ffffff;
      --text-secondary: #b8b8d2;
      --accent-gold: #ffd700;
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      --shadow-lg: 0 10px 40px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.25);
      --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-dark) 0%, #1a1a2e 100%);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Анимированный фон */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, var(--red-glow) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
      animation: pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.7; }
      50% { opacity: 1; }
    }

    /* Частицы */
    .particles {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .particle {
      position: absolute;
      width: 4px;
      height: 4px;
      background: var(--red-light);
      border-radius: 50%;
      opacity: 0.6;
      animation: float 15s infinite linear;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0% { transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(0deg); opacity: 0; }
      10% { opacity: 0.6; }
      90% { opacity: 0.6; }
      100% { transform: translateY(-20vh) rotate(720deg); opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* Контейнер */
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    /* Шапка */
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-light), var(--red-primary), var(--accent-gold));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      animation: glow 2s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes glow {
      from { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.5); }
      to { text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.8), 0 0 35px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.6); }
    }

    header p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    /* Навигация */
    .nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav a {
      padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-primary), var(--red-dark));
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: var(--transition);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .nav a::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -100%;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent);
      transition: left 0.5s;
    }

    .nav a:hover::before {
      left: 100%;
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }

    .nav a.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-light), var(--red-primary));
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.4);
    }

    /* Карточки постов */
    .post {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.2);
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: slideUp 0.5s ease-out forwards;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .post:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .post:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    .post:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .post:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
    .post:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }

    @keyframes slideUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .post::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red-dark), var(--red-primary), var(--red-light));
      transform: scaleX(0);
      transform-origin: left;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
    }

    .post:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      border-color: var(--red-primary);
    }

    .post:hover::before {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }

    .post-date {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-primary), var(--red-dark));
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: white;
    }

    .post h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .post p, .post blockquote {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .post blockquote {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--red-primary);
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      font-style: italic;
      background: rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.08);
      border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
    }

    /* Ссылки */
    .post a {
      color: var(--red-light);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: var(--transition);
      position: relative;
      padding-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .post a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--red-light);
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .post a:hover::after {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .post a:hover {
      color: var(--accent-gold);
    }

    /* Код и данные */
    .code-block, .data-block {
      background: #0d0d15;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.2);
      position: relative;
    }

    .code-block::before {
      content: '💻';
      position: absolute;
      top: 8px;
      right: 12px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .data-block {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
    }

    .metric {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 0.3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent-gold);
    }

    /* Кнопки */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-primary), var(--red-dark));
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: var(--transition);
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-light), var(--red-primary));
    }

    .btn:active {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      border: 2px solid var(--red-primary);
      color: var(--red-light);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: var(--red-primary);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Изображения */
    .post img {
      max-width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      display: block;
      transition: var(--transition);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .post img:hover {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }

    /* Теги */
    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .tag {
      padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
      background: rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid var(--red-primary);
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--red-light);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .tag:hover {
      background: var(--red-primary);
      color: white;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* Футер */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem 2rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.3);
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--red-light);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Анимация появления при скролле */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
      transition: all 0.6s ease;
    }

    .reveal.active {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    /* Адаптивность */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
      
      .nav {
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      
      .nav a {
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      
      .post {
        padding: 1.4rem;
      }
      
      .code-block {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        padding: 1rem;
      }
    }

    /* Уведомления */
    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--red-primary);
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      transform: translateX(150%);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      z-index: 1000;
      max-width: 350px;
    }

    .toast.show {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }

    .toast.success {
      border-left-color: #22c55e;
    }

    .toast.error {
      border-left-color: #ef4444;
    }

    /* Плавная прокрутка */
    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Частицы фона -->
  <div class="particles" id="particles"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Шапка -->
    <header>
      <h1>✨ Мой блог</h1>
      <p>Путешествие в тысячу миль начинается с одного шага</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Навигация -->
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#latest" class="active">📰 Последние</a>
      <a href="#ml">🤖 ML & Код</a>
      <a href="#crypto">🔐 Крипто</a>
      <a href="#files">📁 Файлы</a>
      <a href="mailto:sofi.vasilek100@mail.ru" class="btn-outline">✉️ Написать</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Посты -->
    <main>
      <!-- 18 февраля 2026 -->
      <article class="post reveal" id="latest">
        <span class="post-date">18 февраля, 2026</span>
        <h2>👟 Топ-3 предсказаний модели</h2>
        <div class="data-block">
          <div><strong>running shoe:</strong> <span class="metric">99.45%</span></div>
          <div><strong>shoe store:</strong> <span class="metric">0.27%</span></div>
          <div><strong>clogs:</strong> <span class="metric">0.15%</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">#ComputerVision</span>
          <span class="tag">#AI</span>
          <span class="tag">#Predictions</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 25 февраля 2026 -->
      <article class="post reveal">
        <span class="post-date">25 февраля, 2026</span>
        <h2>🤖 FAQ Bot: Ответ на вопрос</h2>
        <p><strong>Вопрос пользователя:</strong> Сколько ждать мой заказ?</p>
        <p><strong>Найден FAQ-вопрос:</strong> Как быстро доставляется заказ? <em>(sim=0.706)</em></p>
        <blockquote>
          <strong>Ответ бота:</strong> Наш стандартный срок доставки — 3–5 рабочих дней. 📦
        </blockquote>
